            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Mì 362",
            "review_text": "spktravels\nTallman, New York360 contributions\n0\nI am giving Banh Mi 362 a\nDec 2019\nI am giving Banh Mi 362 a 4 because it is very inexpensive and the food is good. \n\nThe restaurant is fast food with a variety of sandwiches served on banh. I had a fried egg sandwich and my wife had a pork sandwich. My sandwich contained onions, greens and a little bit of chili pepper. \n\nThere is very limited seating outside.\nRead more\nWritten December 26, 2019",
